I'll create a function that recursively merges two dictionaries without mutating the originals. The approach will check if both values are dictionaries and, if so, merge them recursively; otherwise, the value from the second dictionary will overwrite the first. Edge cases include handling non-dictionary values, empty dictionaries, and ensuring the original inputs remain unchanged.

